# OPTIONAL — you do not need this file to build the installer.
#
# By default the installer build generates a secure random Linux login
# password for the server machine and prints it during the build.
# Your Suite Manager owner account is NOT configured here; it is created
# in the browser after the first boot.
#
# To pin any value, copy this file to selfhost-installer.env in the same
# folder and uncomment the lines you want:

# LINUX_PASSWORD=your-machine-login-password
# STACK_DOMAIN=mos.home
# TIMEZONE=Europe/Copenhagen
# HOSTNAME=mos
# USERNAME=mos
# REALNAME=My Own Suite
